{"id":208,"date":"2018-04-17T23:19:02","date_gmt":"2018-04-18T03:19:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/technobabble.guru\/montclairhoa\/?page_id=208"},"modified":"2026-09-25T21:47:27","modified_gmt":"2026-09-26T01:47:27","slug":"faq","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/faq\/","title":{"rendered":"FAQ"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"208\" class=\"elementor elementor-208\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-11277524 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"11277524\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-19163544\" data-id=\"19163544\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1779d624 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1779d624\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Q:\u00a0\u00a0When are the annual homeowner assessments due?<\/p><p>A:\u00a0 The annual homeowner assessments are due by April 15th of each year, after which a late fee of $30.00 will be applied. <strong><u>There is a $10.00 discount for any resident who pays their dues prior to January 31<sup>st<\/sup><\/u><\/strong> of each year. If you have not received your invoice for HOA Fees, please email our bookkeeper at &#8211; <a href=\"mailto:montclairbookkeeper@gmail.com\">montclairbookkeeper@gmail.com<\/a><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p><p>Q:\u00a0\u00a0 Where do I send the homeowner dues payment?<\/p><p>A:\u00a0 You can still mail a check or pay your HOA dues online, <a href=\"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/hoa-payment-portal\/\">click here<\/a> or navigate to the Payment Portal on the homepage. You can also send payments to Montclair Association, Inc. P.O. Box 204015 Augusta, GA 30917. If you have not received your invoice for HOA Fees, please email: <a href=\"mailto:montclairbookkeeper@gmail.com\">montclairbookkeeper@gmail.com<\/a><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p><p>Q:\u00a0 Who do I call to report a streetlight that is burned out?<\/p><p>A:\u00a0 You can call Georgia Power at 888-891-0938 to report any streetlights out or Augusta 311.\u00a0\u00a0Be prepared to give them an address or intersection.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p><p>Q:\u00a0\u00a0 Can we swim at the pool if we do not live in Montclair?<\/p><p>A:\u00a0 Guests of members are welcome at the pool but must be accompanied by a Pool Member and pay any guest fees that apply. Pool memberships are offered to Montclair residents and non-residents. You can fill out a membership form at the pool or pay for your membership online <a href=\"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/pool-online-payment-portals\/\">click here<\/a>. For more pool information <a href=\"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/pool\/\">click here<\/a> or email &#8211; <a href=\"mailto:montclairpoolaug@gmail.com\">montclairpoolaug@gmail.com<\/a><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p><p>Q: Are the tennis courts available free to residents?<\/p><p>A: No. The tennis or pickleball courts require Membership. For information on the current Resident or Non-Resident membership rates <a href=\"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/tennis-pickleball-courts\/\">click here<\/a> or email <a href=\"mailto:arheins@gmail.com\">arheins@gmail.com<\/a><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p><p>Q: Is the pavilion near the pool available for rent?<\/p><p>A: Yes! The pavilion is free for Montclair residents but must be reserved by emailing <a href=\"mailto:montclairhoa17@gmail.com\">montclairhoa17@gmail.com<\/a> or <a href=\"mailto:montclairpavilion@gmail.com\">montclairpavilion@gmail.com<\/a> . The pavilion can be rented by non-residents at a small fee.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p><p>Q: I want to make changes to the outside of my house; do I need to approval?<\/p><p>A: Possibly. the covenants regulate certain architectural elements, so it is best to get approval by filling out an Architectural approval form. <a href=\"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/Architectural-Modification-Request-Form.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Click here<\/a> for the form or email <a href=\"mailto:montclairhoa17@gmail.com\">montclairhoa17@gmail.com<\/a><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p><p>Q: How do I get a copy of the By-Laws and Covenants?<\/p><p>A: <a href=\"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/covenants-by-laws\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Click here<\/a> to download a copy of the by-laws and covenants for Montclair.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p><p>Q:\u00a0\u00a0To whom do I report an issue at one of the parks?<\/p><p>A: To report any issues with any common area, park, tennis courts or the pool, please contact <a href=\"mailto:montclairhoa17@gmail.com\">montclairhoa17@gmail.com<\/a> or a board member. <u>Any emergency or criminal activity should be reported to the Richmond County Sheriff&#8217;s Office @\u00a0<a href=\"tel:706-821-1080\">706-821-1080<\/a><\/u><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p><p>Q: Who do I call to report homeless or vagrant activity?<\/p><p>A: Richmond County Marshals Office at <a href=\"tel:706-821-1080\">706-821-2368<\/a><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p><p>Q: Who do I call if I see suspicious activity?<\/p><p>A: Richmond County Sherriff\u2019s Office at <a href=\"tel:706-821-1080\">706-821-1080<\/a><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p><p><strong>These are some frequent requests that should be made to the City of Augusta and 311.<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Request sidewalks to be repaired or you see that a street sign is missing.<\/li><li>Request Road to be resurfaced or patched.<\/li><li>Request trash pickup or an issue with trash missed.<\/li><li>Submit a complaint regarding city ordinance violations?<\/li><li>Requesting mosquito treatment in your yard or backyard?<ul><li><strong>Who do you contact?<\/strong> Augusta Cares 311 <a href=\"tel:706-821-2300\">706-821-2300<\/a> or you can download the Augusta <a href=\"tel:311\">311<\/a> app <a href=\"https:\/\/www.augustaga.gov\/2831\/MyAugusta-311\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Click here<\/a><\/li><li><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Be Advised:<\/strong> <\/span>The new 311 app: is <strong>SeeClickFix<\/strong> for iPhone or android.<\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">..<\/span><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone\" src=\"https:\/\/th.bing.com\/th\/id\/R.1d62a4328056a4d9089b68a09fff60af?rik=mirQExR3gpEuVg&amp;riu=http%3a%2f%2fecosistemaurbano.org%2fwp-content%2fuploads%2fseeclickfix_654-620x240.png&amp;ehk=aOCatwde0plFeR1suYE1sP9b37acY7WiSReVVPVlwdc%3d&amp;risl=&amp;pid=ImgRaw&amp;r=0\" alt=\"SeeClickFix, a powerful digital tool for the collective management of ...\" width=\"390\" height=\"151\" \/><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Q:\u00a0\u00a0When are the annual homeowner assessments due? A:\u00a0 The annual homeowner assessments are due by April 15th of each year, after which a late fee of $30.00 will be applied. There is a $10.00 discount for any resident who pays their dues prior to January 31st of each year. If<\/p>\n<div class=\"re-read-more\"><a class=\"read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/faq\/\">Read More&#8230;<\/a><\/div>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-208","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/208","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=208"}],"version-history":[{"count":40,"href":"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/208\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1681,"href":"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/208\/revisions\/1681"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=208"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}